						708011002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Swan"
				},
				{
					"id": 708011002,
					"content": "To the northwest of Mondstadt are some ruins. Legend holds that it was once a city where a tyrant ruled from his tower. It has since been occupied by Dvalin, who shelters himself there.",
